"""
01_preprocess_control_data.py
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Control Rationalisation — Step 1 of 4: Data Preprocessing

Loads, validates, normalises, and enriches the two input files.
Produces a single expanded Parquet file (one row per product + CT + control)
that all downstream scripts read from.

Outputs (all written to OUTPUT_DIR):
  expanded_product_control_mapping.parquet  — main expanded dataset
  data_quality_report.xlsx                  — data quality metrics
  processing_log.txt                        — appended by all scripts
  run_config.json                           — config snapshot for audit

Run:
  python 01_preprocess_control_data.py
  python 01_preprocess_control_data.py --force   # overwrite existing output
"""

